00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:22.020
The successor of the Indara Jaei Genma style.

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:24.760
Miyamoto Iroha, an assassin!

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:29.210
We are here to take Inuzuka Koushi's life!

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:32.030
Assassins?

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:35.420
There really are people who want to kill me...

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:38.170
Don't worry, Hanzo.

00:15:38.430 --> 00:15:40.310
My eyes are wide open now.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:41.630
Sorry to make you worry.

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:43.020
Sis!

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:44.080
En garde!

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:51.270
I guess I have no choice but to fight.

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:55.330
That is if you interfere with us.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:58.230
For the sake of the Miyamoto group.

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:01.240
For my beloved Koushi-dono's sake.

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:09.710
Let's fight!

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:16.260
Stop staring at each other, get it over with, and save me already!

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:19.610
There is no need for sis to dirty her hands.

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:22.630
Let's go, Kuzuryuu Momoko!

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:24.700
Prepare yourself!

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:28.760
What...?

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:31.770
Too bad, you...

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.390
...can not hurt me!

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:37.570
Whoa!

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:42.430
You bitch, I'm your next opponent!

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:43.710
My thought exactly!

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:52.220
Shit... She's strong.

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:54.170
Eat this!

00:16:56.960 --> 00:16:58.010
Now is my chance!

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:01.180
Indara Jaei Genma style, ultimate technique!

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:04.110
Mikatsu Kiri!

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:04.110
Translation: The slash that can cut through three suns and three moons.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:08.400
I did it!

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:12.700
Shout Bazooka Strike!

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:13.600
She's not hurt...

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:15.630
She countered it!?

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:16.910
She's strong...

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:18.910
I can't win...

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:20.340
I can't match her...

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:22.070
I'll be killed!

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:31.970
Ha... Hanzo...

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:37.880
This is the harbor where I first met you, isn't it.

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:41.160
Sis...

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:45.000
My vision is becoming blurry...

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:51.090
But please stay as the sis who I saw on that day...

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:54.410
Even when I'm not around...

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:58.360
Han... zo...

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:06.110
Hanzo!!

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:11.120
Hanzo, I'll win, I'll win for sure.

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:13.910
I will not let your sacrifice...

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:17.410
...to go to waste!

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:20.610
Go for it, sis, go for it!

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:23.810
He's alive! That guy's alive!

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:26.330
Hanzo... Father...

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:30.320
Now I will use the clan's strongest...

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:32.050
...power!

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:35.590
I will wager everything with this one hit!

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:37.590
What fierce battle aura...

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:39.850
To think there is a martial artist like this...

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:45.340
I will also give it my all with this next hit!

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:48.280
Indara Jaei...

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:49.860
Haira Ichiden...

00:18:50.010 --> 00:18:51.210
...Genma style...

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:52.760
...Musou style...

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:53.660
ultimate technique!

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:55.660
Hiryuu Issen Ken!

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:55.660
Translation: The sword of a flying dragon in a flash.

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:57.610
Sousatsu Madara Giri!

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:57.610
Translation: The twin slash that killed the evil dhra.

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:12.150
You did it! Sis is the victor!

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:16.780
I was a step too slow...

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:23.400
Sis!!

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:26.260
Sis!

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:27.730
Sis!

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:29.690
Sis!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.550
Who is calling out my name?

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:36.390
Hanzo?

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:38.540
I'm glad you are awake.

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:40.980
I'm alive?

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:42.530
I thought I was gonna be killed...

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:45.350
That just proves how strong you are.

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:51.340
If you continue to improve, in another two years...

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:55.020
I might be the one who will be killed.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:20:00.290
It's my first time to fight against a martial artist as good as you.

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:03.680
I will always remember you in my heart!

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:07.150
Kuzuryuu Momoko...

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:09.710
But I feel sad.

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:17.390
Why did a martial artist like you resort to dirty schemes like assassination?

00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:21.380
The Miyamoto group still has such loyal subordinate...

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:24.310
...such passion...

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:28.600
...and a sublime successor...

00:20:29.510 --> 00:20:32.670
...Miyamoto Iroha!

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:36.700
I... I...

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:39.520
I have opened my eyes.

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:45.390
I will find a new way to make our clan proud.

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:47.880
And to revive our clan.

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:49.120
You can do it.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:50.550
If it's Iroha-dono.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:53.940
I will support you!

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:56.050
Momoko-dono...

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:57.890
Iroha-dono...

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:04.860
I'm so glad I met you.

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:06.330
Me too.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:11.780
Martial art is such a wonderful thing!

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:25.220
Wha...!?

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:28.720
You are awake? It's alright now.

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:30.680
Uh...

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:32.720
Who are you?

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:39.910
I'm just a Tenchuu warrior who's passing by...

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:42.090
Tenchuu warrior...

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:44.720
Uma Kamen...?

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:17.200
You are unconcerned even when my adoration for you has been shaken.

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:17.200
kogareta omoi wo butsukete mo anata wa suruusuru

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:17.200
焦がれた想いをぶつけてもアナタはスルーする

00:22:17.780 --> 00:22:21.450
Words alone can't express it.

00:22:17.780 --> 00:22:21.450
kotoba dake ja tsutawaranai no

00:22:17.780 --> 00:22:21.450
言葉だけじゃ伝わらないの

00:22:22.300 --> 00:22:28.270
Maybe I should change my hair style to with frill and lace and attack again.

00:22:22.300 --> 00:22:28.270
kamigata wo kaete furiru to reesu de semeyoukana

00:22:22.300 --> 00:22:28.270
髪型を変えてフリルとレースで攻めようかな

00:22:29.130 --> 00:22:34.270
Where is the one-hit-for-the-kill ultimate technique?

00:22:29.130 --> 00:22:34.270
ichigeki hisatsu no ougi wa izuko ni

00:22:29.130 --> 00:22:34.270
一撃必殺の奥義はいずこに

00:22:34.610 --> 00:22:38.750
Love is not a game.

00:22:34.610 --> 00:22:38.750
koi wa geemu ja nai kedo

00:22:34.610 --> 00:22:38.750
恋はゲームじゃないけど

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:43.030
With victory at stake, LET'S MAKE LOVE TONIGHT.

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:43.030
shoubu wo kakete LET'S MAKE LOVE TONIGHT

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:43.030
勝負をかけて LET'S MAKE LOVE TONIGHT

