00:23:09.840 --> 00:23:12.290
In the next episode of Sumomomo Momomo...

00:23:13.310 --> 00:23:16.230
It's the story about "the assassin from the tiger clan, appears!"

00:23:17.020 --> 00:23:19.430
I'll give my innocence to you.
